  "label": "Internet Meme Culture",
  "description": "The meme references the broader cultural phenomenon of internet memes — humorous, often viral images or videos that spread rapidly online. The frustration expressed in the text is rooted in the reality that meme creators frequently face backlash or moderation for their content, even when it is popular or well-intentioned. This cultural context is necessary to understand the self-referential nature of the meme.",
